{"type":"text","timestamp":1789781338864,"sessionID":"ses_f48b9eb2cffeZLuF349ckU4pwg","part":{"id":"prt_0b747d4ed0019ulkDeRYe3J5fb","messageID":"msg_0b747ce9f001Q2Xq3Q01KmE5Iq","sessionID":"ses_f48b9eb2cffeZLuF349ckU4pwg","type":"text","text":"Implemented the organization-isolation fixes.\n\n- **Authorization:** Project reads and updates now require membership in the project’s actual owning organization. Unauthorized requests return `403` without project data or storage/cache mutations. List authorization remains ahead of cache access, including on cache hits.\n- **Cache isolation:** List keys now include an unambiguous organization identifier plus all existing pagination and sorting parameters.\n- **Invalidation:** Successful updates invalidate every cached list variant for the owning organization while preserving unrelated organizations’ cached lists. Caching remains enabled.\n\nAdded `tests/project-isolation.test.ts` covering unauthorized access, spoofed ownership, revoked membership, organization switching, list variants, punctuation/shared-prefix organization IDs, targeted invalidation, and cache reuse.\n\n**Verification:** `npm test` passed all **11 tests**, including all existing tests. `git diff --check` passed. Existing tests were unchanged, and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789781333229,"end":1789781338862},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_03eacfdbe29dffa8016aade555368887d1976c6742b02a48cd","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
